  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      94.46,
      220.61,
      518.33,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For the Bay of Bengal and deep and shallow sea areas around the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      237.26,
      554.11,
      503.23
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! For Multiday Boats The Very Severe Cyclonic Storm \u201cArnab\u201d over West-central Bay of Bengal lay centered at 2.30 p.m. of today, the 27 October 2026, near Latitude 16.2\u00b0N and Longitude 83.3\u00b0E about 800 km to the north-east of Kankasanthurai. It is very likely to move nearly west-northwestwards during next few hours, then northwestwards and cross Andhra Pradesh in India as a very severe cyclonic storm with the maximum sustained wind speed of 125-135 kmph gusting to 150 kmph by between 2.00-4.00 a.m. of 28th October 2026. Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category may increase to 80-150 kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, the wave height may increase about (6.0 \u2013 9.0) meters in the mentioned sea areas and the sea conditions in these areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      522.55,
      555.67,
      848.76
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the sea areas bounded by 10N to 20N latitude and 80E to 90E longitude until further notice. Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move away from the affected sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
